# 📅 Day 7 – Design System in Figma

## 📌 Project Overview

On Day 7 of my UI/UX Design Internship, I created a **Design System** for my Food Delivery Mobile Application using **Figma**.

The goal was to make the UI more consistent, reusable, and easier to maintain by organizing colors, typography, buttons, spacing, and other design elements.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🎨 Brand Color Palette
- 🔤 Typography Styles
- 🔘 Reusable Button Components
- 📏 Spacing Guidelines
- 📐 Border Radius
- 🌑 Shadow Styles
- 📱 Improved Mobile UI Screens
- 🛒 Login, Home, Search, Cart & Success Screens

---

## 🛠 Tools Used

- Figma

